1
00:00:12,408 --> 00:00:17,036
Bonjour ! Comment tu t'appelles ?
Hello! What's your name?

2
00:00:17,136 --> 00:00:21,404
Je m'appelle Adrien. Et toi ?
My name is Adrien. And you?

3
00:00:21,504 --> 00:00:26,660
Moi, c'est Marinette. Enchantée !
I'm Marinette. Nice to meet you!

4
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:30,140
Enchanté, Marinette !
Nice to meet you, Marinette!

5
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:35,564
Bonjour, monsieur. Comment vous appelez-vous ?
Hello, sir. What is your name?

6
00:00:35,664 --> 00:00:41,012
Je m'appelle Adrien Martin. Et vous, madame ?
My name is Adrien Martin. And you, madam?

7
00:00:41,112 --> 00:00:46,412
Je m'appelle Marinette Dupont. Enchantée.
My name is Marinette Dupont. Pleased to meet you.

8
00:00:46,512 --> 00:00:49,724
Enchanté, madame.
Pleased to meet you, madam.
